---@field priority? number The priority of the firewall rule.
---@field firewallRuleType? gcp.networkmanagement_v1.FirewallInfoFirewallRuleTypeEnum|string The firewall rule's type.
---@field targetServiceAccounts? gcp.networkmanagement_v1.StringList The target service accounts specified by the firewall rule.
---@field policyUri? string The URI of the firewall policy that this rule is associated with. This field is not applicable to VPC firewall rules and implied VPC firewall rules. Format: * `locations/global/firewallPolicies/{policy}` (hierarchical policy) * `projects/{project}/global/firewallPolicies/{policy}` (global network firewall policy) * `projects/{project}/regions/{region}/firewallPolicies/{policy}` (regional network firewall policy)
---@field networkUri? string The URI of the VPC network that the firewall rule is associated with in format "projects/{project}/global/networks/{network}". This field is not applicable to hierarchical firewall policy rules.
---@field action? string Possible values: ALLOW, DENY, APPLY_SECURITY_PROFILE_GROUP
---@field uri? string The URI of the firewall rule in format * `locations/global/firewallPolicies/{policy}/priority/{priority}` (hierarchical policy) * `projects/{project}/global/firewallPolicies/{policy}/priority/{priority}` (global network firewall policy) * `projects/{project}/regions/{region}/firewallPolicies/{policy}/priority/{priority}` (regional network firewall policy) * `projects/{project}/global/firewalls/{firewall}` (VPC firewall rule). This field is not applicable to implied VPC firewall rules.
---@field policy? string The name of the firewall policy that this rule is associated with. This field is not applicable to VPC firewall rules and implied VPC firewall rules.
---@field targetTags? gcp.networkmanagement_v1.StringList The target tags defined by the VPC firewall rule. This field is not applicable to firewall policy rules.
---@field direction? string Possible values: INGRESS, EGRESS
---@field policyPriority? number The priority of the firewall policy that this rule is associated with. This field is not applicable to VPC firewall rules and implied VPC firewall rules.
---@field displayName? string The display name of the firewall rule. This field might be empty for firewall policy rules.
---@field targetType? gcp.networkmanagement_v1.FirewallInfoTargetTypeEnum|string Target type of the firewall rule.

